# Web (`apps/web`)

Clean Architecture folders under `src/app/{domain,application,data,presentation}`.

- UI uses **PrimeNG** (current major) and Aura theme. Import PrimeNG only from `presentation`.
- Provide repository implementations in `app.config.ts` via `InjectionToken`s defined in domain.
- Components inject use cases, never `HttpClient` or classes from `data/`.
- Keep TypeScript strict. Prefer standalone components and signals.
